{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_46_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_46","textTraditional":"一、十有七年，春，齊人執鄭瞻。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_46_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_46","textTraditional":"鄭瞻者何？鄭之微者也。此鄭之微者，何言乎齊人執之？書甚佞也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_46_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_46","textTraditional":"二、夏，齊人瀸于遂。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_46_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_46","textTraditional":"瀸者何？瀸積也，眾殺戍者也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_46_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_46","textTraditional":"三、秋，鄭瞻自齊逃來。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_46_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_46","textTraditional":"何以書？書甚佞也。曰：「佞人來矣，佞人來矣。」","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_46_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_46","textTraditional":"四、冬，多糜。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_46_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_46","textTraditional":"何以書？記異也。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}